# 01 写入路径 (Write Path) - 第 3、12 章
# 1. coord 节点路由 → 2. primary shard 写入 → 3. 副本同步 → 4. translog fsync → 5. refresh → 6. segment

sequenceDiagram
  participant App
  participant Coord
  participant Primary
  participant Replica
  App->>Coord: PUT /idx/_doc/1
  Coord->>Coord: hash(routing) → primary shard
  Coord->>Primary: index request
  Primary->>Primary: 写入 in-memory buffer
  Primary->>Primary: append translog
  Primary-->>Replica: replicate
  Replica->>Replica: append translog
  Replica-->>Primary: ack
  Primary-->>Coord: ack
  Coord-->>App: 201 Created

  Note over Primary,Replica: 每 1s refresh: buffer → segment
  Note over Primary,Replica: 每 5s fsync translog
```

```mermaid
# 02 段合并 (Segment Merge) - 第 3、10 章
flowchart LR
  S1[Segment A<br/>1w docs] --> M[Merge]
  S2[Segment B<br/>1w docs] --> M
  S3[Segment C<br/>1w docs] --> M
  M --> N[New Segment<br/>3w docs<br/>deletes merged]
  M -. tombstone .-> T[删除旧段]

  style M fill:#f9f,stroke:#333
```

```mermaid
# 03 倒排索引结构 - 第 3 章
flowchart LR
  T1[Term: elastic] --> P1[Postings:<br/>doc 1, 3, 7, 9<br/>tf=1 pos=[3]]
  T2[Term: search] --> P2[Postings:<br/>doc 2, 3, 5<br/>tf=2 pos=[5,18]]
  T3[Term: lucene] --> P3[Postings:<br/>doc 9<br/>tf=1 pos=[1]]

  subgraph DocStore[Stored Fields _source]
    D1[doc 1]
    D3[doc 3]
    D9[doc 9]
  end

  P1 --> D1 & D3 & D9
```

```mermaid
# 04 Translog 与 Refresh - 第 3、10 章
sequenceDiagram
  participant Doc as Document
  participant Mem as In-Memory Buffer
  participant Seg as Segment (Immutable)
  participant TLog as Translog
  Doc->>Mem: write
  Doc->>TLog: append
  Note over Mem,Seg: 每 1s (default) refresh
  Mem->>Seg: flush to new segment
  Note over TLog: 每 5s fsync (default)
  TLog->>Disk: fsync
```

